failure.message:
1. Test Case ID: okAGPD

- API rejected schema-compliant request

    Valid data should have been accepted
    Expected: 2xx, 401, 403, 404, 5xx

[400] Bad Request:

    `{
      "error": {
        "code": 400,
        "message": "No filter selected. Expected one of: chart, myRating, id",
        "errors": [
          {
            "message": "No filter selected. Expected one of: chart, myRating, id",
            "domain": "youtube.parameter",
            "reason": "missingRequiredParameter",
            "location": "parameters.",
            "locationType": "other"
          }
        ]
      }
    }`

Reproduce with: 

    curl -X GET -H 'Authorization: [Filtered]' https://youtube.googleapis.com/youtube/v3/videos

2. Test Case ID: VLn8wI

- Undocumented HTTP status code

    Received: 404
    Documented: 200, 400, 403

[404] Not Found:

    `{
      "error": {
        "code": 404,
        "message": "The specified content owner account was not found.",
        "errors": [
          {
            "message": "The specified content owner account was not found.",
            "domain": "youtube.parameter",
            "reason": "contentOwnerAccountNotFound",
            "location": "onBehalfOfContentOwner",
            "locationType": "parameter"
          }
        ]
      }
    }`

Reproduce with: 

    curl -X GET -H 'Authorization: [Filtered]' 'https://youtube.googleapis.com/youtube/v3/videos?videoCategoryId=%C2%BD&id=%7CTX%F0%9B%91%92T&id=%C2%83%F0%95%89%92&id=%C2%80l%C3%A19%12&id=%F1%A3%85%85%C2%A9%F4%84%8E%83%24%00%1E%3B%EB%85%A8T%C3%9D%C3%B7&%0A%F3%AB%96%93%F2%BA%81%91%C3%93%C2%8E%C2%BB%5CtR=%C2%8E%0A%C2%A6&%0A%F3%AB%96%93%F2%BA%81%91%C3%93%C2%8E%C2%BB%5CtR=&%0A%F3%AB%96%93%F2%BA%81%91%C3%93%C2%8E%C2%BB%5CtR=%C2%94%C3%BD%C3%B4%C3%B4%C3%B0&onBehalfOfContentOwner=%C3%8CY%C2%BA%1Ak%C3%BE'
